{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000004", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000005"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you look here, right, reasons for changing the job would be like lack of growth opportunity, toxic work environment, misalignment with career goals.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000004"}, {"quote": "So these are the right reasons for changing the job. I'm going to discuss them in detail.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000005"}], "text": "Common reasons for changing a job include lack of growth opportunity, toxic work environment, misalignment with career goals, stagnant compensation, and better opportunities elsewhere."}, "title": "Common Reasons for Job Change", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:knowledge:53df7c4d14821f15", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Common Reasons for Job Change", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000006", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000007", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So you haven't built expertise or or left a lasting impact, running from challenge instead of learning to overcome them.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000006"}, {"quote": "Let me explain these things in depth.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000007"}, {"quote": "Leaving the job will not solve them. Next job also you might get it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000008"}], "text": "Signs you might be changing a job too soon include not building expertise, running from challenges, job hopping for slightly higher salaries, and leaving due to short-term issues."}, "title": "Signs You're Leaving Job Too Early", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:knowledge:6cb3adfb11de1f53", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Signs You're Leaving Job Too Early", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000009", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000010", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000012"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So watching peers move ahead while you feeling stuck.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000010"}, {"quote": "I used to make fun of him saying like you spent your entire youth on the same company.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011"}, {"quote": "So now common mistakes to avoid what are the common mistakes that you should avoid during the job search.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000012"}], "text": "Signs you might be staying too long at a job include feeling bored, no promotion or salary hike, being unappreciated, and watching peers move ahead."}, "title": "Signs You're Staying Too Long at a Job", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:knowledge:616473724eae2b6b", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Signs You're Staying Too Long at a Job", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000012", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000013"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "just because one of your peer peer is like slightly toxic, you want to change the job.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000013"}, {"quote": "So this is like you over enjoyed your welcome.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011"}], "text": "Avoid making job change decisions based on emotions like frustration or burnout, or because others seem to be succeeding."}, "title": "Avoiding Emotional Decisions in Job Change", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:knowledge:965c18aad144fc4f", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Avoiding Emotional Decisions in Job Change", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000012", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000013"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Jumping ship without a solid plan for next like you like just", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000012"}, {"quote": "career is a very long journey, correct?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000013"}], "text": "Have a solid plan before changing jobs and avoid immediate jumps driven by peer comparison."}, "title": "Planning Before a Job Change", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:knowledge:580428ac50d20ded", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Planning Before a Job Change", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000015", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000016"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So one probably you joined a job because you want to work on a project that has like humongous scale like lot of millions of people that it was catering.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000015"}, {"quote": "you want to switch to a job where leadership is given more importance than the development.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000016"}], "text": "Change jobs when you have achieved what you expected from your current role or when seeking new learning opportunities."}, "title": "Importance of Achieving Goals Before Changing Jobs", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:knowledge:80abb63a20dcd4bb", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Importance of Achieving Goals Before Changing Jobs", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000017", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000018", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000019", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000020", "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000021"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you are prepared mentally, professionally and financially.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000017"}, {"quote": "do not consider money as a first thing whenever you want to make a job switch, unless you think you're extremely low paid, okay, if you're moderately paid, have a solid reasons than money while making a job switch, okay?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000021"}], "text": "Financial readiness should be a key consideration alongside professional and personal preparedness before changing jobs."}, "title": "Financial Considerations in Job Change", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:knowledge:33dca2c63cdbf33f", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Financial Considerations in Job Change", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "in one of my previous companies I saw a guy who worked for like twenty two years in the same company.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011"}], "text": "Vasanth describes a person who worked in the same company for 22 years and his salary was similar to someone with less experience."}, "speaker_id": "1", "strategy": null, "title": "Example of Long-Term Job Stay", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:cases:02f408ebc1120333", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Example of Long-Term Job Stay", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000018"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Do not jump too early. What is too early? Too early means like basically you are running away from some problems. You do not know why you are making a job switch.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000018"}], "text": "Vasanth summarizes the discussion by contrasting when moving between jobs might be too early, too long, and the right balance."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Effective Summary of Discussion", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:expression:f6603c48c60bde60", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Effective Summary of Discussion", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "I used to make fun of him saying like you spent your entire youth on the same company.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000011"}], "text": "The speaker uses a personal anecdote about a coworker who stayed at the same company for 22 years to illustrate the point about over-staying in a job."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Personal Anecdote for Illustration", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:expression:c69396d27cb7a390", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Personal Anecdote for Illustration", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000013"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Because career is a very long journey, correct? In a ten year journey or thirty year journey in a career, probably like small small things like this happen, somebody go forward then, you know, that doesn't mean you cannot catch up.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:u000013"}], "text": "Vasanth contrasts people he describes as 'biassed' by peers' trips and benefits with the long-term journey of a career."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Contrast in Career Journeys", "topic": "Job Change"}, "content_hash": "2dc0703349e59eaf0a70e88554a5bf305f3f17335e6353c31637804b25f92414", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0:expression:e55812759e9d1177", "metadata_hash": "a3b40846e70fe08eb33b6153c7811a7293a6d22b82eaa25bd147579473d5c945", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2025-01-18", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "f1adf070370fbda7e12ac2a4f203b262e9389553cd060ce41a3bfee6981633ff", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-18-while-changing-the-job-must-watch-before-changing-the-job-5-9de67d87d0", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubYLbB-A2U", "title": "Contrast in Career Journeys", "topic": "Job Change", "topic_slug": "job-change"}
